    {
      "text": "It can smash concrete blocks with its kicking attacks. The one with the biggest crest is the group leader.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "This Pokémon may be rude, but it takes very good care of its family, its friends, and its turf.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "It taunts its opponents by spitting. It has a certain territory that it never leaves its whole life long.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "As halfhearted as this Pokémon’s kicks may seem, they pack enough power to shatter Conkeldurr’s concrete pillars.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "While mostly known for having the temperament of an aggressive ruffian, this Pokémon takes very good care of its family, friends, and territory.",
      "version": "shield"
    }
